.worktrees/
__pycache__/

# The superpowers entry in .claude-plugin/marketplace.json is sourced from
# ./plugins/superpowers, which is supplied per-checkout rather than vendored
# here: point it at a local clone of the fork (a symlink is fine) and Claude
# Code will dereference it at install time.
#
# Deliberately untracked. Vendoring it would either duplicate an upstream
# repo or bake a checkout-specific path into this public repo, and either way
# every clone that overlays its own copy stops fast-forwarding. Ignoring the
# path lets a clone carry its own wiring and still `git pull --ff-only`
# forever.
#
# No trailing slash: the path is usually a symlink, which git records as a
# blob, and a `dir/` pattern would not match it.
/plugins/superpowers
